plymouth (24.004.60+git20250831.4a3c171d-0ubuntu8.1~rk1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Backport upstream 45655f12 to stop plymouthd looping forever when a
    terminal read ends in the middle of a CSI control sequence. This prevents
    timing-sensitive boot hangs on systems using a serial console.

